  "abstract": "This submission attempts to integrate a simplified global context (Dim 32) into the Fourier Forecaster's main MLP that processes frequency-domain factors. A single global context vector is computed per batch from the entire time-domain input and then concatenated with the flattened frequency factors. This tests a more direct fusion of global information with the core Fourier prediction mechanism, using `proj_rank=36`.",
